/th><td>Offset printing, matte/gloss lamination, aqueous coating, foil, embossing and spot UV.</td></tr><tr><th>Logistics note</th><td>Flat shipping reduces volume, but carton strength and folding accuracy must be controlled.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n  </section>\n  <section><h2>When cardstock boxes are the right choice</h2><p>Cardstock product boxes are ideal when buyers need branded retail packaging without the freight volume of rigid boxes. They are especially useful for product launches, retail displays and food packaging projects.</p></section>\n  <section><h2>Design to manufacturing workflow</h2><p>The workflow includes structure choice, dieline, artwork, material confirmation, sample proof, print production, die-cutting, gluing, QC and flat export packing.</p></section>\n<section class=\"rfq-checklist\"><h2>Procurement Checklist</h2><ol><li>Provide product dimensions and filled weight.</li><li>Confirm whether food contact or grease resistance is required.</li><li>Select opening style and locking method.</li><li>Ask for dieline with bleed, glue flap and barcode quiet zone.</li><li>Confirm carton quantity, carton size and shipping method.</li></ol></section><section class=\"faq-block\"><h2>FAQ</h2><details><summary>What are cardstock product boxes used for?</summary><p>They are used for cosmetics, supplements, snacks, retail products, food packaging and light gift items.</p></details><details><summary>Can cardstock boxes be food safe?</summary><p>Yes, if the paperboard, coating, ink and structure are specified for the intended food packaging use.</p></details><details><summary>What is the advantage over rigid boxes?</summary><p>Cardstock boxes are lighter, foldable and usually more cost-effective for retail runs.</p></details></section><section class=\"rfq-template-box\"><h2>CTA: Ask Lisa for a packaging strategy quote</h2><p>Send product size, target quantity, artwork status, required finish, destination country and launch deadline. BestPackFactory can connect strategy, design, sampling, manufacturing and logistics into one B2B packaging plan.</p><div class=\"rfq-actions\"><a class=\"btn\" href=\"../contact.html\">Request Factory Quote</a><a class=\"btn light\" href=\"../products.html\">View Packaging Products</a></div></section><section><h2>Related Pages</h2><ul class=\"internal-links\"><li><a href=\"../products/food-packaging.html\">Food Packaging</a></li><li><a href=\"../products/bakery-paper-bags.html\">Bakery Paper Bags</a></li><li><a href=\"../products/custom-pizza-boxes.html\">Custom Pizza Boxes</a></li></ul></section></main>\n<footer class=\"footer\">\n<div>\n<h3>BestPackFactory</h3>\n<p>B2B custom packaging manufacturer for boxes, bags, labels, bottles, tins and printing.</p>\n<p>Lisa Wu · lisa@colorprintingpackage.com · WhatsApp +86 158 8653 0985</p>\n<p>Address: Printing Industrial Park, Longhua District, Shenzhen, Guangdong Province, 518109, China</p>\n</div>\n<div><h3>Products</h3><a href=\"../products.html\">All Products</a><a href=\"../products/luxury-magnetic-boxes.html\">Magnetic Boxes</a><a href=\"../products/flexible-packaging.html\">Flexible Packaging</a><a href=\"../products/paper-bags.html\">Paper Bags</a></div>\n<div><h3>Inquiry</h3><a href=\"../contact.html\">Request Quote</a><a href=\"mailto:lisa@colorprintingpackage.com\">Email Lisa</a><a href=\"https://wa.me/8615886530985\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">WhatsApp</a></div>\n</footer>\n<div class=\"bpf-whatsapp-chat\">\n<div class=\"bpf-whatsapp-chat__head\">Need Custom Packaging?</div>\n<div class=\"bpf-whatsapp-chat__body\">\n<strong>MOQ 500 PCS · Fast Factory Quote</strong>\n<p>Click below to contact us quickly by WhatsApp or email. We can help with dieline, samples, printing, materials and worldwide shipping.</p>\n<a class=\"bpf-whatsapp-chat__btn bpf-whatsapp-chat__btn--wa\" href=\"https://wa.me/8615886530985?text=Hello%20BestPackFactory%2C%20I%20need%20a%20custom%20packaging%20quote.\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">💬 Chat 